    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">What it is: A role borne by an entity that supplies electrical power to a scenario bus. BFO/IOF placement: role. Why it is here: Provides a common semantic classification for gas, wind, solar, and imported sources without changing their physical equipment classes.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
